=== B. IS OVERTIME STILL A DECISION, WITH REGULARS IN? same mornings, same seeds, n=300 per cell ===
hearts.x presses only while every heart on the counter is above x. stake leaves shippers out of that. calm also wants nobody outside and at most two others at the counter; calm-2 stops after two rounds. d$ is against never. sd is the spread of a shift.
